  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your anticipation of your foe’s attacks makes you difficult to hit.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Snake Style<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using Snake Style, add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) on Sense Motive checks you make to use the result as your AC or touch AC against an attack. In addition, you can use this feat as a free action rather than an immediate action by spending one use of your mythic power.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc85\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
